<div id="activity1" class="section light-purple" style="display:none;">
  <h1>Meditation</h1>
  <p>Keep your mind calm and focused with daily meditation sessions.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Morning mindfulness – 10-15 min breathing exercises</li>
    <li>Evening reflection – Journaling or guided meditation</li>
    <li>Stress relief – Short exercises to reduce anxiety</li>
    <li>Tips: Create a quiet space, maintain consistency, track time</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div id="activity2" class="section light-purple" style="display:none;">
  <h1>Exercise</h1>
  <p>Track your physical activity to maintain a healthy body.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Cardio – Jogging, cycling, or brisk walking</li>
    <li>Strength training – Weights or bodyweight exercises</li>
    <li>Flexibility – Yoga or stretching routines</li>
    <li>Consistency tips: Schedule workouts, set achievable goals, track progress</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div id="activity3" class="section light-purple" style="display:none;">
  <h1>Diet Tracking</h1>
  <p>Log your meals and monitor nutrition for a balanced lifestyle.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, and Snacks – Keep daily records</li>
    <li>Calories – Track intake vs. target</li>
    <li>Macronutrients – Protein, carbs, fats balance</li>
    <li>Tips: Plan meals ahead, drink water, avoid processed foods</li>
  </ul>
</div>
